    {
      "id": "rcckjiz",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Meaning of Nutrition"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Nutrition involves five sequential processes: Ingestion, Digestion, Absorption, Assimilation, and Egestion.",
        "Carbohydrates and Fats serve as energy sources, while Proteins are vital for growth and tissue repair.",
        "Vitamins are classified into Fat-Soluble (A, D, E, K) and Water-Soluble (B-complex and C).",
        "Essential minerals like Calcium, Iron, Iodine, and Sodium perform structural and metabolic regulatory roles.",
        "Malnutrition encompasses both undernutrition (leading to PEM diseases like Kwashiorkor and Marasmus) and overnutrition."
      ],
      "id": "hj6d34z"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "x69ruok",
      "content": "• Nutrition is the process of obtaining food and utilizing it for energy and body functions."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fp3bgrx",
      "content": "• It includes ingestion, digestion, absorption, assimilation and excretion."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "acj53mz",
      "content": "• Good nutrition helps maintain physical and mental health."
    },
    {
      "id": "ih7warv",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2. Steps in Nutrition"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "70vjfk8",
      "content": "• Ingestion – Taking food into the body."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0wwn1hi",
      "content": "• Digestion – Breaking down complex food into simple molecules."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9erd2ey",
      "content": "• Absorption – Nutrients enter the bloodstream through the intestine."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rups00l",
      "content": "• Assimilation – Nutrients used by cells for energy and growth."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "f1qvvgy",
      "content": "• Egestion – Removal of undigested waste."
    },
    {
